flowchart TD
    A[🏁 You push code to GitHub main] --> B[1️⃣ Checkout source code]
    B --> C[2️⃣ Set up Docker Build tools]
    C --> D[3️⃣ Log in to GHCR storage locker]
    D --> E[4️⃣ Create Firebase secret key file]
    E --> F[5️⃣ BUILD Docker image locally on GitHub]
    
    F --> G{6️⃣ Does dist/src/main.js exist inside image?}
    
    G -->|❌ NO| H[🛑 WORKFLOW FAILS<br/>No broken image published<br/>VPS keeps running last good version]
    
    G -->|✅ YES| I[7️⃣ Publish image to GHCR locker]
    I --> J[8️⃣ SSH into your VPS]
    J --> K[9️⃣ Write .env file from secret]
    K --> L[🔟 Log into GHCR on VPS]
    L --> M[1️⃣1️⃣ Pull new image]
    M --> N[1️⃣2️⃣ Force-restart app container]
    N --> O[✅ App is live on VPS]

